    "source": "Public owner photographs and shooting notes; https://hendigi.com/digital-harinezumi-2-double-plus/ ; https://hendigi.com/digital-harinezumi-again/ ; https://blindlight.wordpress.com/2010/08/10/superheadz-digital-harinezumi-2-review/",
